rows.en:
I see...
Well then, it can't be helped.
I'll tell you.{p}

Can't you feel it?
The overwhelming aura filling this space...
It's slamming into me, wham, wham, so hard it hurts.{p}

...Shh!
Listen carefully...
Can't you hear a thin voice, sobbing?{p}

There was nothing.
The shoe locker was empty.
Forget a nice find, there weren't even any shoes or indoor shoes in it.{p}

".........Whoa, this is amazing!"
.........Hopeless.
He was completely lost in his own world.{p}

Honestly, why did Hino invite someone like this?
And honestly, why did I pick this guy first?
Cursing my bad luck, I hurried back to the club room with everyone.{p}
